# @clerk/clerk-react CVE-2026-42349 (HIGH, auth bypass when combining flows).
# Fixed in clerk-react 5.61.6, but @clerk/nextjs 5.7.6 (latest v5) pins the older
# clerk-react; remediation requires a Clerk v6+ major upgrade across all four apps
# (breaking auth changes). Deferred to a dedicated Clerk-upgrade task. Mitigated by
# defense-in-depth: every server action re-checks the role server-side and the
# middleware enforces MFA, so the app does not rely on clerk-react alone for authz.
# Reviewed 2026-09-30. Re-evaluate when the Clerk v6 migration is scheduled.
